<title>USA: Wyndham Hotel Corp Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Wyndham Hotel Corp Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.14		    $0.08</p>
<p> Net			  2,769		    1,586</p>
<p> Revs			41,415		   35,384</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  20,018		   20,108</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.48		    $0.33</p>
<p> Net			  9,628		    6,563</p>
<p> Revs		     121,500		  104,770</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  20,018		   20,018</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1995 results are pro forma to reflect the completion of the company's initial public offering, the issuance of $100 million of senior subordinated notes, the sale/leaseback of 11 hotels with Hospitality Properties Turst and the application of all proceeds as though the transactions had occurred at the beginning of each period.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
